言える。","nextNodeIds":[705070208,705070209]},{"nodeId":705070208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2147890394,"text":"褒めすぎだって…","nextNodeIds":[705070210]},{"nodeId":705070210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1080908082,"text":"そっか、なるほどな。","nextNodeIds":[705070211]},{"nodeId":705070211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":877835746,"text":"じゃあ…お茶の味わい方をオイラにも教えてくれよ。まずは匂いをかいで、それから飲めばいいのか？","nextNodeIds":[705070212]},{"nodeId":705070212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":1695648042,"text":"ああ、そうだ。","nextNodeIds":[705070213]},{"nodeId":705070213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":4233222402,"text":"茶葉にはそれぞれ特徴がある。茶を飲んでいくうちに、それが自然と分かってくることだろう。茶の香りをかぐことで、その良し悪しも多少分かるようになるはずだ。","nextNodeIds":[705070214]},{"nodeId":705070214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":1916799018,"text":"湿った匂いと強く焦げた香りがする茶は、質のよくないものだ。一方、甘美でまろやかな香りがする茶は質がいい。","nextNodeIds":[705070215]},{"nodeId":705070215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":3380144594,"text":"よりこだわりたいのであれば、璃月に古くから伝わる「品香杯」を使うといいだろう。これは香りを味わうための専用の茶器だ。","nextNodeIds":[705070216]},{"nodeId":705070216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1955737370,"text":"ど、どうしよう。なんだかこれまでずっと、お茶で損をしてきたんじゃないかって気になってきたぞ…","nextNodeIds":[705070217]},{"nodeId":705070217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":553623770,"text":"気にするな、学問とは奥深いものだ。いつ始めようとも遅すぎるということはない。","nextNodeIds":[705070218]},{"nodeId":705070218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":4032786314,"text":"初めてであれば——まず湯の色を観察し、そして香りを楽しみ、最後に茶をいただくといい。","nextNodeIds":[705070219]},{"nodeId":705070219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":1375882402,"text":"「浅いところから入り、徐々に深きところへと歩を進めていく」、これはあらゆる物事に通ずることでもある。","nextNodeIds":[705070220,705070221]},{"nodeId":705070220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1729128874,"text":"勉強になった…","nextNodeIds":[705070222]},{"nodeId":705070222,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":527466578,"text":"璃月の北西にある「翹英荘」は茶業で有名だ。機会があれば、そこへ行ってみるといい。","nextNodeIds":[705070223]},{"nodeId":705070223,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":1636467786,"text":"ただ今日話したことの大半は、璃月の伝統を重んじる俺の習慣にすぎない。","nextNodeIds":[705070224]},{"nodeId":705070224,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":3648562530,"text":"茶を飲む習慣や文化は、地域によって異なるものだ。異国の地では、その土地の習慣を尊重すべきだということも忘れないでくれ。","nextNodeIds":[705070225]},{"nodeId":705070225,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1885676122,"text":"オイラ、完全に理解したぞ！覚えられるかどうかは怪しいけど…","nextNodeIds":[705070226]},{"nodeId":705070226,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2897488442,"text":"やっぱり…","nextNodeIds":[705070227]},{"nodeId":705070227,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":2637136354,"text":"#{NICKNAME}、礼を言おう。このようないい茶を飲むことができ、足を運んだ甲斐があったというものだ。","nextNodeIds":[705070228]},{"nodeId":705070228,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":2529381138,"text":"もし、いつかお前が茶館に立つ日があったら、必ず俺も行こう。","nextNodeIds":[705070229]},{"nodeId":705070229,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3229178994,"text":"でもオイラたち忙しいし、茶館で働くヒマなんてないかもしれないぞ…","nextNodeIds":[705070230]},{"nodeId":705070230,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3677815722,"text":"どうだろうね…","nextNodeIds":[705070231]},{"nodeId":705070231,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":1433029130,"text":"いずれにせよ、機会があれば俺は助力する。","nextNodeIds":[705070232]},{"nodeId":705070232,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":2469168258,"text":"さて、今日はこのくらいにしておこう。お前達の仕事が上手くいくよう祈っている。","nextNodeIds":[705070233,705070234]},{"nodeId":705070233,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2132117306,"text":"うん、気を付けて帰って。","nextNodeIds":[705070235]},{"nodeId":705070235,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":1541962258,"text":"ふむ。代金はいつも通り、往生堂に請求しておいてくれ。","nextNodeIds":[705070236]},{"nodeId":705070236,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1588866682,"text":"じゃあなー！堂主にもよろしくな！","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":705070234,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2992517250,"text":"えっと、お会計は…","nextNodeIds":[705070235]},{"nodeId":705070221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":153205658,"text":"もっと知りたい…","nextNodeIds":[705070222]},{"nodeId":705070209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1497974338,"text":"ちょっと恥ずかしい…","nextNodeIds":[705070210]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7050702,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1068,50],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LEAVE_SCENE_RANGE","PPFLKMOMKAI":"Q7050204_Play"}],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["10232"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":1068,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7050701,7050702],"speakerCounts"